barycentricSubdivision -- the barycentric subdivision of a simplicial complex.
******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        barycentricSubdivision D
        barycentricSubdivision F
  * Inputs:
      * D, an *note abstract simplicial complex:
        (SimplicialComplexes)SimplicialComplex,,
      * F, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of facets defining a
        simplicial complex
  * Outputs:
      * an *note abstract simplicial complex:
        (SimplicialComplexes)SimplicialComplex,, the barycentric subdivision of
        a simplicial complex of D

Description
===========

The following example uses the simplicial complex on four vertices composed of
two disconnected edges.

+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a,b,c,d];                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = {a*b,c*d};                                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : D = simplicialComplex F                                      |
|                                                                  |
|o3 = simplicialComplex | cd ab |                                  |
|                                                                  |
|o3 : SimplicialComplex                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : barycentricSubdivision D                                     |
|                                                                  |
|o4 = simplicialComplex | v_0v_4v_6 v_0v_3v_6 v_0v_2v_5 v_0v_1v_5 ||
|                                                                  |
|o4 : SimplicialComplex                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : barycentricSubdivision F                                     |
|                                                                  |
|o5 = simplicialComplex | v_0v_4v_6 v_0v_3v_6 v_0v_2v_5 v_0v_1v_5 ||
|                                                                  |
|o5 : SimplicialComplex                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

