universalSOP -- Universal System of Parameters (USOP)
*****************************************************

  * Usage: 
        universalSOP D
        universalSOP F
  * Inputs:
      * D, an *note abstract simplicial complex:
        (SimplicialComplexes)SimplicialComplex,,
      * F, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of facets defining a
        simplicial complex
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of elements from the
        Stanley-Reisner ring of D

Description
===========

The following example uses the simplicial complex consisting of a triangle of
dimension 2 attached to an edge and a isolated vertex.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/2[a..e];                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = {a*b*c,c*d,e}                                |
|                                                      |
|o2 = {a*b*c, c*d, e}                                  |
|                                                      |
|o2 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : D = simplicialComplex F                          |
|                                                      |
|o3 = simplicialComplex | e cd abc |                   |
|                                                      |
|o3 : SimplicialComplex                                |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : universalSOP D                                   |
|                                                      |
|o4 = {a + b + c + d + e, a*b + a*c + b*c + c*d, a*b*c}|
|                                                      |
|o4 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : universalSOP F                                   |
|                                                      |
|o5 = {a + b + c + d + e, a*b + a*c + b*c + c*d, a*b*c}|
|                                                      |
|o5 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+

